m?id=47397822\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 1268\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 849\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.timesofisrael.com/gamblers-trying-to-win-a-bet-on-polymarket-are-vowing-to-kill-me-if-i-dont-rewrite-an-iran-missile-story/","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397822","date_published":"2026-03-16T12:00:06Z","author":{"name":"defly","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=defly"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397797","title":"MoD sources warn Palantir role at heart of government is threat to UK security","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://www.thenerve.news/p/palantir-technologies-uk-mod-sources-government-data-insights-security-state-secrets\"\u003ehttps://www.thenerve.news/p/palantir-technologies-uk-mod-sources-government-data-insights-security-state-secrets\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397797\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397797\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 573\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 232\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.thenerve.news/p/palantir-technologies-uk-mod-sources-government-data-insights-security-state-secrets","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397797","date_published":"2026-03-16T11:57:33Z","author":{"name":"vrganj","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=vrganj"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397593","title":"Corruption erodes social trust more in democracies than in autocracies","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/political-science/articles/10.3389/fpos.2026.1779810/full\"\u003ehttps://www.frontiersin.org/journals/political-science/articles/10.3389/fpos.2026.1779810/full\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397593\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397593\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 628\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 323\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/political-science/articles/10.3389/fpos.2026.1779810/full","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397593","date_published":"2026-03-16T11:25:31Z","author":{"name":"PaulHoule","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=PaulHoule"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397574","title":"Why I love FreeBSD","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eArticle URL: \u003ca href=\"https://it-notes.dragas.net/2026/03/16/why-i-love-freebsd/\"\u003ehttps://it-notes.dragas.net/2026/03/16/why-i-love-freebsd/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397574\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397574\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 328\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 152\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://it-notes.dragas.net/2026/03/16/why-i-love-freebsd/","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397574","date_published":"2026-03-16T11:23:14Z","author":{"name":"enz","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=enz"}},{"id":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397190","title":"Ask HN: What is it like being in a CS major program these days?","content_html":"\n\u003cp\u003eHow has the curriculum changed? What are the professors telling their students to explain why the course they enrolled in deserves the rigorous study? Are the students buying it - and is it matching reality at the end of the course? It’s hard to get a feel from the continuous pendulum swing of “it’s dead” to “it’s better than ever”. As much as I am scared with my own career, I am worried about my nephews’. What advice to give them, when all their life I have advocated for CS as a fulfilling career choice? \nP.S. I have pivoted to best time to be solopreneur. “But what about uni then?”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComments URL: \u003ca href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397190\"\u003ehttps://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397190\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePoints: 159\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e# Comments: 164\u003c/p\u003e\n","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397190","external_url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47397190","date_published":"2026-03-16T10:24:02Z","author":{"name":"tathagatadg","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/user?id=tathagatadg"}}]}